{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>荃灣有人猝死。昨日（16日）下午4時許，一名41歲女子在河背街46號住所睡房暈倒，丈夫見狀報案。</p><p>救護員接報到場，女事主昏迷被送往仁濟醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，女事主來自印尼，持有香港身份證。</p><figure><img alt=\"女事主昏迷被送往仁濟醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1187926729713258496721594.jpeg/wHey6qVBuXlcqI7qeVkORA8JX1pShtIQglB-EbhQfhE\"/><figcaption>女事主昏迷被送往仁濟醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T23:19:01.623058+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:43:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T06:38:01.045517+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T23:17:47.462955+00:00","content_hash":"1932538bdcfac74586d9f33c4d869255554be476e910807ad47413555153b5f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}